<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"So, what do you want to do?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">after all, it's a bit..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2">'s eyes I avoided as I answered.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At that, a big sigh from </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
"I get it, sorry. Yeah, that figures."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2">'s hopes I wanted to meet, but I simply could not face going outside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Going out when a frightening incident like that has happened...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Going to the scene of the incident, still more so, is a hurdle far too high for me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Well, never mind that, it's time to order pizza!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In an instant </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> changed her expression and started up the internet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> apologized to me, but somehow I am the one who feels sorry.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, let's go after all. I'm feeling pretty good today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, it's fine, it's fine! Pizza first! <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, which one do you like?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> turned the screen to me, as though to change the subject.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I have made her put herself out for me again...</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
